# Platform: mobilesite
# Story: GJDT-22417 — the same photo shows the 360° icon on the Photos grid but NOT in the single-image gallery (requirement: gallery "Not to be done")
# Tags: b2b, pdp, 360, GJDT-22417
# Params : prot3_pdp_360_photos

open ${prot3_pdp_360_photos}
wait for page to load
wait until element pdp_first_photo is visible
store position of pdp_photo_360_icon in pdp_photo_tile_image as grid_icon_position
click pdp_first_photo
wait until element gallery_slide_image is visible
wait 2 seconds
verify element gallery_360_icon is not visible
take screenshot as both_surfaces_gallery
